    "summary": "Once per phase, this unit can be the target of the [Fire Overwatch](vsdata:ability/core.fire-overwatch) Stratagem even if that Stratagem has been used already in the phase. If it is:\n\n- an unmodified [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) of 4+ scores a hit for [Snap Shooting](vsdata:core-rule/snap-shooting) attacks by this unit until that Stratagem resolves\n- that use does not stop that Stratagem being used on other units in the phase",
